          "value": "<p>A creature within 5 feet of the muzzle can use an action to make a DC 15 Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) or Strength (Athletics) check to jam the barrel. On a success the next time the crawler fires its Fury Cannon the shot misfires: it detonates on the crawler instead, dealing 4d8 fire damage to it (its resistance applies), and the cannon can't fire again until a creature spends one minute clearing it.</p>",
